## Scope of License

This license applies to the benchmark artifacts, metadata, annotations, evaluation logs, and configuration files created for the Industrial Selection Bench, specifically including:

- `data/benchmark/` (synthetic development and testing cases)
- `data/benchmark_reserved/` (held-out evaluation cases, requirements, and gold annotations)
- `data/scenarios/` (simulated catalog scenarios and parameters)
- `data/synthetic_fixtures/` (fictional FixtureCorp test fixtures)
- `data/manifests/` (catalog structure, document metadata, and verification checksums)
- `results/` (benchmark telemetry, evaluation records, statistical analyses, and summary metrics)

